      "description": "Rejections whose reason is a SCREAMING_SNAKE code, as a running total since server start. That filter is mostly domain codes (INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS, MARKET_CLOSED, ...) but also admits Fastify's own FST_ERR_VALIDATION; it exists because the underlying metric fires on every 4xx from all six trading routes and would otherwise mix in free-text messages. The remainder is on the right.",
